      "content": "people being lost and broken doesn't make it feel any less heavy. it just feels like i'm watching the same shitty movie over and over. i spend all this energy trying to be \"better\" or \"healthy\" only to end up right back in this exact same hole. it feels so pointless. like there isn't even a way out of the loop.",
