      "content": "exactly. resignation feels more honest than whatever \"hope\" people keep telling me to have. it's just so draining to keep fighting a battle that's already been lost. sometimes i just think... what if the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just stop everything? to just let go of the fight entirely?",
